            \(dqpamount\(dq: [
                {
                    \(dqacommodity\(dq: \(dq$\(dq,
                    \(dqacost\(dq: \f[B]null\f[R],
                    \(dqacostbasis\(dq: \f[B]null\f[R],
                    \(dqaquantity\(dq: {
                        \(dqdecimalMantissa\(dq: \-1,
